Subject: [Pico Linux] Add 64-bit fence chains with explicit legacy wrapping

Port Linux b312d8ca3a7c, 5e498abf1485 and 078dec3326e2 prerequisites.
Import dma-fence-chain.c/h from Linux v5.4.302 (9e3157c56ec7), including
iterative chain release and its stable lifetime fixes. Existing KGSL and
software fences retain 32-bit wrap comparison unless ops explicitly opt in.
Adapt the vendor trace format to the widened counter; rebuild all modules.
Upstream authors and licenses are retained. See docs/pico-drm-timeline-backport.md.

